[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その調子だ。上手いぞ、天使ちゃん。\n才能あるぜ！\u3000しかもまだまだ伸びる！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's it! You're doing great, little angel. You've got real talent! And plenty of room to grow, too!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この操舵に皆さんの命運が懸かっていると思うと……\nふぅ。ありがとうございます、ランツェさん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone's lives are in my hands when I'm at the helm... Thanks you for believing in me, Lanze."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ははは！\u3000じゃあそろそろ交代するか。\n天使ちゃんは、そこの計器を見ててくれるか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hahaha! Well, your shift's almost up. Could you keep an eye on those gauges over there?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい。\nええと、教えていただいた通り、記録を取りますね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. I'll keep records like you showed me."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "勉強熱心ですね、フロッケさん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You're quite the dedicated student."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "少しでも皆さんの足を引っ張らないように\n頑張らないと",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I need to work hard so I don't slow everyone down."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "船旅ではどんな不測の事態が起きるか\n分かりませんから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You never know what might happen during a sea voyage."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "フロッケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Flocke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "船長が船酔いで倒れたりするかもしれないしね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The captain might get seasick and collapse, for instance."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "誰が倒れるか。何年船乗りやってると思ってんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Who's gonna collapse?! You know how long I've been at this?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まぁ、本番まではまだまだあるんだ。\nそこの二人みたいに、肩の力抜こうぜ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, we've still got time before the real thing. Try to relax like those two over there!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "肩の力抜くっていうか……レスナのほうはあれ\n完全に船酔いしてない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Relaxing...? I think Resna's getting seasick over there."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お二人とも、大丈夫ですか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you two doing alright?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ん？\u3000私はこういうのぜんぜん平気よ！\n丈夫なホムンクルスでよかったわ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hm? I'm totally unaffected! Being a homunculus has its perks!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わ、私も……だいぶ慣れてきました。\nちょっとふらつきますけど……あはは……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-I'm... getting used to it. Just a bit dizzy... haha..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "顔色、あんまり良くないですけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You don't look so good..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "トトリ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Totori"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "辛かったら船室で横になってこいよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Go plonk down in the cabin if you're feeling sick."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "い、いえ！\u3000本番に向けて訓練しなければ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "N-no! I need to train for the real thing!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ははは！\u3000無理しすぎねぇようにな！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hahaha! Just don't push yourself too hard!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ランツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lanze"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "頑張るわね、レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You've got this, Resna."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]